{"uuid": "d8cd0b43-6b80-4f75-ae52-3de00938ec4f", "message": "0110001010110001010011101010100100101101011011000001011010010101", "container": "Social media has greatly impacted relationships in today's society. It has transformed the way people connect, communicate, and form relationships. With the rise of platforms like Facebook, Instagram, and Twitter, individuals now have the ability to stay connected with friends and loved ones 24/7. However, this constant connectivity has also led to some negative consequences. Social media can create unrealistic expectations, increase jealousy, and even cause misunderstandings. Despite these drawbacks, it cannot be denied that social media has also provided a platform for people to meet and connect with others who share similar interests and values. Overall, social media's influence on relationships is a double-edged sword.", "encoded_message": "Societal channels features significantly altered interactions within contemporary community. It has changed the manner individuals link, interact, and create relationships. Given the emergence of services such as Facebook, Instagram, and Twitter, users currently possess the capacity to remain in touch with acquaintances and cherished individuals 24/7. Nevertheless, this continuous connection has additionally resulted in to certain detrimental outcomes. Social media may generate unattainable hopes, amplify envy, and actually induce confusions. In spite of these disadvantages, it cannot be disputed that social media has also offered a forum for people to gather and connect with others who have comparable passions and ethics. Generally, social channels' influence regarding relationships is a double-edged sword.", "secret_key": [{"Social": {"00": "Communal", "01": "Societal", "10": "Public", "11": "Collective"}}, {"media": {"0": "outlets", "1": "channels"}}, {"has": {"0": "features", "1": "possesses"}}, {"greatly": {"00": "significantly", "01": "considerably", "10": "substantially", "11": "